<title>FRANCE: La Poste to create 5,000 jobs for young - Le Monde.</title>
<headline>La Poste to create 5,000 jobs for young - Le Monde.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French Post Office plans to create 5,000 jobs for young people by end June 1998, state secretary for industry Christian Pierret said in a newspaper interview.</p>
<p>&quot;...Besides hiring 3,000 people through contracts and 1,500 civil servants in 1997, La Poste will hire an additional 2,500 young people this year and as many during the first half of 1998..,&quot; Pierret told French afternoon daily Le Monde.</p>
<p>These young people will get full-time five-year contracts, he specified. La Poste will use the extra staff to improve customer services.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
